# a fixed paper list: check the status after 'add' to see whether it takes these sizes at all.
#
#   .\open-pdf-printer-forms.ps1                 status only, changes nothing
#   .\open-pdf-printer-forms.ps1 -Action add     add the missing sizes   (elevated PowerShell)
#   .\open-pdf-printer-forms.ps1 -Action remove  remove the sizes added  (elevated PowerShell)
#
# 'add' never changes an existing form; 'remove' only removes what 'add', the installer or the
# app added. Both can be repeated safely. The printer itself is never touched.
